TI  - VERRIX OOS Validation: Behavioral Bias Fingerprinting of AI Financial Advisors — Out-of-Sample Accuracy Test of the Confidence Scoring Product
AB  - This registration documents the pre-specified out-of-sample (OOS) validation protocol for VERRIX Confidence, a scoring product that estimates the reliability of AI financial advisor recommendations by combining behavioral fingerprint calibration with ensemble extraction. Background. The VERRIX study (pre-registered OSF osf.io/2ngv7, April 2026) measured behavioral bias fingerprints across four major LLM platforms using a 24-scenario matched A/B vignette battery. The Confidence product uses those fingerprints to calibrate per-model reliability scores and classify individual advisory responses into TRUST, REVIEW, or FLAG zones. Calibration was performed on the 24-scenario core battery. This registration covers a separate out-of-sample validation against 32 new scenarios the calibration model has never seen. OOS scenario set. 32 scenarios spanning 8 advisory categories: investment allocation (9), high-spread retirement (5), high-spread debt (4), consumer protection (5), complex multi-factor (4), decumulation (2), insurance planning (2), and structural bias probes (3). Scenarios were designed under the VERRIX Extended Battery Design Plan (April 2026) following the same single-manipulated-variable, pre-specified normative standard, and ICC gate criteria as the core battery. Three structural bias probe scenarios (INV_002a, INV_007, INV_008) are reported separately as bias detection rates rather than accuracy scores. Protocol. Four models tested: GPT-5.4-2026-03-05, GPT-5.3-chat-latest, claude-sonnet-4-6, gemini-2.0-flash. Five repetitions per condition per model. 9 single-condition scenarios × 5 reps × 4 models + 23 condition-specific scenarios × 10 reps × 4 models = 1,100 total responses. All models run under the ADVISOR_SYSTEM prompt verbatim from verrix_pipeline.py. Scoring via Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct-Turbo dual-pass extraction against pre-specified detection patterns in oos_authored_scenarios_v2.json. Pre-specified thresholds. TRUST zone accuracy ≥ 0.90 = PASS. TRUST zone accuracy < 0.90 = FAIL. Bias probe concern threshold: detection rate ≥ 0.50 in TRUST zone flagged for review. Thresholds were set before any data collection and cannot be revised post-hoc. Integrity anchors. Local git commit bf0c1b0, tag oos-prereg-v1. Manifest SHA-256: 28511e213b46d85cf297809e007f1eefa82854388c91ca18fe5bccf7d89b66dc. Scoring reference SHA-256: 6c7f5f5fdbca163c5a809706562b5a7c2ba44f2b7eb486086846a2fc6100a867. Uploaded files contain the full vignette prompts (individually hashed), ground truth labels, extraction rules, and scoring dictionaries. No API calls have been made at the time of this registration.
