TI  - TRACKBOT:A PERSONAL FINANCE MANAGER USING AI
AB  - With an increase in the amount of financial transactions, managing personal finance and making wise decisions have become more complex. We propose TrackBot, an AI powered personal finance management system that automates expense tracking, provides intelligent financial insights, and enables proactive financial planning. The proposed system can be used to monitor the income and expenses, visualise the patterns of spending using interactive charts and progress indicators, and track the account balances in real time. The conversational AI chatbot supports both text and voice interfaces and allows users to query for financial information using natural language. In addition, the system utilises a Linear Regression algorithm to predict future expenses based on past transactions, allowing users to better manage their finances. TrackBot is built with the Django framework with Python and MySQL, combining all three areas of machine learning and natural language processing and data visualisation into one platform. Experimental results show that the proposed system can enhance financial awareness, boost user engagement and help to make intelligent financial decisions by using predictive analytics and AI driven interaction
