TI  - HMC-AI: An AI-Driven Human Money Control System for Intelligent Personal Finance Management
AB  - Human Money Control-AI (HMC-AI) represents a shift in personal finance from passive monitoring to active, transparent intelligence.Whereas many traditional applications are just digital books where one can track bills, HMC-AI applies explainable AI to help users conduct a comprehensive study and improvement of their saving and spending habits.The system is built according to principles of user autonomy and privacy and does not require intrusive direct connection with bank accounts, but allows individuals to input the data manually or upload their personal financial documents and statements.The platform uses the analytical capabilities of Large Language Models (LLMs) to go beyond data visualization to provide informative financial insights, in a form of narrative.This structure skillfully transforms raw records of transactions into operational intelligence and gives customized budgetary guidance and comparative trend assessments.Ultimately, HMC-AI allows one to understand the cause of their financial health, relate complex data to proactive decisions, and ensure that the user has full access to his or her data.
