TI  - ROLE OF GENERATIVE AI IN INNOVATION AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT IN THE FINANCIAL LITERACY OF INDIA
AB  - The widespread use of digital devices in India enhances the potential for financial literacy within the country. With the embrace of technological advancements, it is evident that the younger generation is increasingly influenced by artificial intelligence. This Generative AI is set to play a vital role in the rapidly evolving financial landscape of India, and the sustainable progress of education hinges on how the government implements technological innovations and disseminates them across various platforms. Digital tools like chatbots and AI- based financial campaigns are increasingly shaping how different age group approach investments. With support from the government and AI influencers, financial education can be accessible throughout the nation, reaching every regional language and facilitating effective communication. The study evaluates how Generative AI contributes to sustainable development by promoting responsible financial practices, highlighting its role in guiding individuals on their investment journeys. It also addresses the challenges and emphasizes the necessity for a strong regulatory framework to mitigate risks associated with data privacy and misinformation. Employing a questionnaire survey method, this paper seeks to understand the expectations of various age groups regarding the influence of artificial intelligence on their financial decision-making, covering aspects from everyday spending and value investing to future aspirations. Keywords: Generative AI, Sustainable Development, Financial Literacy, Technological Advancement.
