TI  - AI DRIVEN TRANSFORMATION IN THE FINANCIAL INDUSTRY
AB  - Abstract: The financial industry has undergone a significant transformation driven by Artificial Intelligence (AI), revolutionizing traditional services. AI technologies, including machine learning, deep learning, and natural language processing (NLP), are automating routine processes, improving operational efficiency, and reducing human errors. In banking, AI enhances credit scoring, fraud detection, and customer support through chatbots. Insurance companies leverage AI for claims processing, risk assessment, and personalized policies. In investment management, algorithmic trading and robo-advisors optimize portfolio decisions. Fintech firms utilize AI for secure payments, transaction monitoring, and financial analytics. The adoption of AI strengthens decision-making, predictive analysis, and customer personalization. Despite its advantages, challenges in data privacy, cybersecurity, ethical AI, and regulatory compliance remain. Future trends include explainable AI (XAI), AI-blockchain integration, and hyper-personalized financial solutions. This study highlights that strategic AI deployment is essential for sustainable growth and competitive advantage in the financial sector. Keywords: Artificial Intelligence (AI), Financial Industry, Banking, Investment Management, Insurance, Fintech, Fraud Detection, Predictive Analytics, Robo-Advisors, Operational Efficiency, Customer Experience, Machine Learning, Natural Language Processing (NLP), Regulatory Compliance, Data Privacy
