TI  - A STUDY ON CONSUMER TRUST AND ADOPTION OF AI-BASED FINANCIAL SERVICES IN LUCKNOW
AB  - The rapid advancement of Artificial Intelligence (AI) has significantly transformed the financial services industry by introducing innovative solutions such as AI-powered chatbots, automated fraud detection, intelligent credit scoring, robo-advisory services and personalised financial recommendations. These technological developments have enhanced the efficiency, accessibility and convenience of financial services. However, the successful adoption of AI-based financial services largely depends on consumer trust, awareness, perceived security and concerns regarding data privacy. The present study aims to examine consumer trust and adoption of AI-based financial services in Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh. The study focuses on identifying consumer awareness, usage patterns, perceived benefits, security concerns and factors influencing the acceptance of AI-driven financial solutions.
